{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brave the Known World and lead one of five asymmetric races to vanquish your enemies and push back the Timefront. Recruit, combat and expand your territory in this thrilling new take on the old and beloved genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cinematic Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/Teaser-GIF.gif?t=1742591533\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself on a rich, character-driven story and fight back against Oroch to reclaim the lands lost to the Timefront. This roguelike campaign will ensure replayability is fresh and engaging in every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Your Own Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/Legion_Formation.gif?t=1742591533\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your race, commander, units and artifacts to customize your own playstyle before the game begins. Tweak your composition after every match to min/max your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/Conquest.gif?t=1742591533\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skills on casual skirmishes against players from around the world. You can take it one step further and try the competitive ladder and tournaments for rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Raids</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/Legion_vs_Watchman.gif?t=1742591533\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Party-up with your friends or guildmates to overcome difficult scenarios against the AI in this challenging co-op game mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Custom Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/Worldshaper.gif?t=1742591533\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Worldshaper, Timefront's game editor, to build your own custom games and publish them. If they become popular with the community, you can monetize them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you in the Known World!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3328840?t=1742591533","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3328840?t=1742591533","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/5c9edff0ac77fecd296e445c482e85f39decf79f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742591533","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/5c9edff0ac77fecd296e445c482e85f39decf79f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742591533","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brave the Known World and lead one of five asymmetric races to vanquish your enemies and push back the Timefront. Recruit, combat and expand your territory in this thrilling new take on the old and beloved genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cinematic Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/Teaser-GIF.gif?t=1742591533\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself on a rich, character-driven story and fight back against Oroch to reclaim the lands lost to the Timefront. This roguelike campaign will ensure replayability is fresh and engaging in every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Your Own Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/Legion_Formation.gif?t=1742591533\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your race, commander, units and artifacts to customize your own playstyle before the game begins. Tweak your composition after every match to min/max your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/Conquest.gif?t=1742591533\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skills on casual skirmishes against players from around the world. You can take it one step further and try the competitive ladder and tournaments for rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Raids</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/Legion_vs_Watchman.gif?t=1742591533\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Party-up with your friends or guildmates to overcome difficult scenarios against the AI in this challenging co-op game mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Custom Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/Worldshaper.gif?t=1742591533\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Worldshaper, Timefront's game editor, to build your own custom games and publish them. If they become popular with the community, you can monetize them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you in the Known World!</p>","developers":["Flama Craftworks"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/header.jpg?t=1742591533","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2024 Flama Craftworks.All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>M